*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  Global marker NC <-> PLC
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*  Legend:
*
*    X_      = axis X
*    Y_      = axis Y
*    Z_      = axis Z
*    4_      = axis 4
*    5_      = axis 5
*    S_      = spindle
*    Volt    = voltage
*    Posit   = positioning
*
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

